WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:02.251
- [Man] Oh boy, c'mere! (kissing noises)

00:00:02.251 --> 00:00:04.096
- [Woman] Lunie, come on. Come on.

00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:08.256
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.256 --> 00:00:11.426
- Luna's pretty fair with
her love, like, you know

00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:14.851
she always makes sure that
if she's cuddling one of us,

00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:18.217
that she'll take a break
and go visit the other one.

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:19.355
- [Woman in Blue] That's
Molly's dog, Elsa.

00:00:19.355 --> 00:00:20.690
- [Woman in Grey] We both
have very different roles,

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:21.677
I think, so.

00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:23.233
- I think Molly makes all the rules.

00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:25.485
- Like the fun aunt that
always shows up with candy.

00:00:25.485 --> 00:00:28.260
- Yeah, I give her scraps of my food

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.897
and play with her on the floor.

00:00:29.897 --> 00:00:30.942
- You give her scraps of your food?

00:00:30.942 --> 00:00:31.859
- No, I mean, no.

00:00:31.859 --> 00:00:33.322
- [Son] Who does she love more?

00:00:33.322 --> 00:00:34.402
Definitely me.

00:00:34.402 --> 00:00:35.493
- [Father] I would have to disagree.

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.867
I think she definitely loves me more.

00:00:36.867 --> 00:00:38.198
- She sleeps right next to me.

00:00:38.198 --> 00:00:40.125
- That's because you smell like her.

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:41.542
- [Daughter] Her, forever.
- Me.

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:44.119
- They are stuck to her like glue.

00:00:44.119 --> 00:00:45.571
Anywhere she goes they trail behind her.

00:00:45.571 --> 00:00:47.161
She goes to the bathroom
and they wait at the door.

00:00:47.161 --> 00:00:51.759
(upbeat music)

00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:53.744
- [Husband] Luna, come
here! (kissing noises)

00:00:53.744 --> 00:00:55.137
Come here, sweetheart.

00:00:55.137 --> 00:00:56.205
Good girl.

00:00:56.205 --> 00:00:58.307
C'mon.

00:00:58.307 --> 00:00:59.864
- Brittany!
- Like really?

00:00:59.864 --> 00:01:01.153
- Rita come over here.
- Rita!

00:01:01.153 --> 00:01:02.272
- Rita Rita Rita.

00:01:02.272 --> 00:01:03.253
- Here Rita, Rita!

00:01:03.253 --> 00:01:04.289
- Ri, Ri, Ri!
- Oh no no no.

00:01:04.289 --> 00:01:05.990
- Stay, stay.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:08.488
- C'mere. (clapping)

00:01:08.488 --> 00:01:09.234
Luna.

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:10.210
- Yes, yes..

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.297
- C'mere buppus.

00:01:11.297 --> 00:01:12.691
Oh!

00:01:12.691 --> 00:01:14.360
- Rita, Rita!
- Rita.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.746
- Rita, this way, this way, Rita!

00:01:15.746 --> 00:01:18.681
- C'mon. (kissing noises)

00:01:18.682 --> 00:01:19.603
Stay.

00:01:19.603 --> 00:01:20.785
- Off to a great start.

00:01:20.785 --> 00:01:22.072
- That's not staying!

00:01:22.072 --> 00:01:24.835
Turn, Rita!

00:01:24.835 --> 00:01:26.496
- Rita, Rita, Rita!

00:01:26.496 --> 00:01:28.307
- Lay down.

00:01:28.307 --> 00:01:29.793
- Oh yeah, oh yeah.

00:01:29.793 --> 00:01:30.966
Ah ha, don't have anything!

00:01:32.104 --> 00:01:32.881
- Luna.

00:01:32.881 --> 00:01:34.277
- Luna...
- I'm gonna go, bye bye!

00:01:34.277 --> 00:01:35.703
- C'mere, c'mere sweetheart.
- Bye bye!

00:01:35.703 --> 00:01:36.927
(bell dings)
Awwwwww.

00:01:36.927 --> 00:01:38.349
- Oh boy.

00:01:38.349 --> 00:01:40.381
- [Woman] Pretty much what I expected.

00:01:40.381 --> 00:01:41.770
- Rita, Rita, Rita,
Rita, Ohhhh! (bell dings)

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.499
- Hey cutie, mwa!

00:01:43.499 --> 00:01:45.060
- [Father] Rita, that's a betrayal.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.359
- [Mom] Come here, my boy,
come here! (bell dings)

00:01:47.359 --> 00:01:48.266
- Well.

00:01:49.128 --> 00:01:51.898
- [Woman in Blue] Come here! No!

00:01:53.144 --> 00:01:55.149
- I was not that surprised
that she picked him.

00:01:55.149 --> 00:01:56.414
She's very much a Daddy's girl.

00:01:56.414 --> 00:01:57.586
She follows him around.

00:01:57.586 --> 00:01:58.946
- And it wouldn't have
mattered either way.

00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:00.908
- Yeah, we know she loves us both.

00:02:00.908 --> 00:02:02.498
- I felt kind of cheated.

00:02:02.498 --> 00:02:04.251
I still think she loves me more.

00:02:04.251 --> 00:02:05.668
- Elsa didn't choose either of us.

00:02:05.668 --> 00:02:07.711
She just decided to run away.

00:02:07.711 --> 00:02:10.370
Yeah, we're not surprised.
She does love freedom.

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:11.589
- I love you the most.

00:02:11.589 --> 00:02:14.220
- That's all that matters,
that's all that matters.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:15.513
(upbeat music)

00:02:15.513 --> 00:02:16.511
- This is what it takes.

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:17.681
- This is the only way

00:02:17.681 --> 00:02:18.892
that she'll stay in place.

00:02:20.722 --> 00:02:22.096
- You're a big baby.

00:02:23.249 --> 00:02:25.473
A big baby.

